/></span> Fishing - some common fish, but also unique fish requiring research!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find</strong> <strong>Fish Parts</strong> and<strong> use different bait</strong> to hook various fish!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629830/extras/c3960d40aede31bccdf58c810ff50fdc.avif?t=1785051934\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629830/extras_big/c3960d40aede31bccdf58c810ff50fdc.avif?t=1785051934 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629830/extras/b6ffc4ee72fea15dc08fda1e349b9d9b.webp?t=1785051934\" width=22 height=22 /></span> Dive deep into the Mines! </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mine ores and gems</strong> in the Mines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Certain plants and creatures can be found only in the Mines!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629830/extras/696631bcbaaa0436a6391022f5882d57.webp?t=1785051934\" width=22 height=22 /></span>Explore the puzzle caves to uncover the mystery behind Shimmerbrook</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete puzzles to obtain Artifacts</strong>! Each puzzle you solve brings you one step closer to learning the truth behind the proliferation of flora and fauna in Shimmerbrook.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629830/extras/57cc5fbb9c982104ffa3a538d023705f.avif?t=1785051934\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629830/extras_big/57cc5fbb9c982104ffa3a538d023705f.avif?t=1785051934 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629830/extras/f99239aad9f7d6643b43889acd5c46e6.webp?t=1785051934\" width=22 height=22 /></span> Cook, craft, build, and more!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cook meals</strong> to gain buffs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft and automate</strong> with sprinklers, auto-feeders, and more!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629830/extras/62ad4dcdb8042e32a0e16bba4989c7e9.webp?t=1785051934\" width=22 height=22 /></span> Meet the townsfolk!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Befriend townsfolk</strong>! From a druid whose family has lived for generations in the mountains, to a featherfolk whose first job is in this new town - many characters await in Shimmerbrook!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Schedule Hangout Events</strong> with them to learn more about their stories!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Romance</strong> any of the 10 romanceables and marry your favourite!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629830/extras/8c66a7d57a38bc8504b40ee3e0a5cb39.avif?t=1785051934\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629830/extras_big/8c66a7d57a38bc8504b40ee3e0a5cb39.avif?t=1785051934 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629830/extras/49d061f1ef1f548f76886bb3f0324445.avif?t=1785051934\" width=600 height=195 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Set out to discover and record plants and creatures for the Violet Archive. Grow crops, tame animals, and build the perfect farm! Forge friendships along the way as you begin your life as a researcher!", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629830/985440d41000e9b2425a0b691a02613b47a6100f/header.jpg?t=1785051934", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629830/6d119818067431807ece9afa6d439755f3bf1fc4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785051934", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629830/6d119818067431807ece9afa6d439755f3bf1fc4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785051934", "website": "https://petalcatgames.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7, 8, 8.1 and 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660Ti<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "PetalCatGames © 2021", "developers": ["Petal Cat Games"], "publishers": ["Petal Cat Games", "Electronic Sheep Games"], "demos": [{"appid": 1855880, "description": ""}], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 1499, "final": 1499, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$14.99"}, "packages": [578668], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Research Story", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid": 578668, "percent_savings_text": " ", "percent_savings": 0, "option_text": "Research Story - $14.99", "option_desc